    "detailed_description": "Minimalist style domino sandbox. Build your domino effect with unlimited pieces, customizable colors and reversibility.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Well-crafted build tool make it fun and easy to try out new ideas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Minimalist style with maximum customization. Express your artistic mind through the customization feature.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Don't be afraid to push and have fun with your creation. You can revert every placed pieces back anytime. Build - Push - Revert - Repeat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Imagine magic domino box with unlimited pieces inside. Limitation is only your imagination.<br><br><br><br>Key Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[Freely add / rotate / flip / remove pieces.All placed pieces can be revert back anytime.Pieces and ground's colors can be customize.Unlimited pieces. ]</ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Minimalist style domino sandbox. Build your domino effect with unlimited pieces, customizable colors and reversibility.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/7c8116ad253a9fe0065736ea9df1ee78.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Well-crafted build tool make it fun and easy to try out new ideas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/91c14a77cabd35b906d6e85c36acbffd.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Minimalist style with maximum customization. Express your artistic mind through the customization feature.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/02412bdb0fe79386efcd26914ff50351.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Don't be afraid to push and have fun with your creation. You can revert every placed pieces back anytime. Build - Push - Revert - Repeat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.poster.avif?t=1743092852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.webm?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677520/extras/c24f87f0db55b02318439ece5bdd9e1b.mp4?t=1743092852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Imagine magic domino box with unlimited pieces inside. Limitation is only your imagination.<br><br><br><br>Key Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[Freely add / rotate / flip / remove pieces.All placed pieces can be revert back anytime.Pieces and ground's colors can be customize.Unlimited pieces. ]</ul>",
